# Line-coverage floor (percent of lines) for scripts/coverage.sh, one line
# per coverage tool, because llvm-cov and gcov count lines differently.
# The script fails below the floor and prints the value to record when the
# total has risen by a whole percent; raise the floor in the same change.
# Values are whole percent, rounded down from the measured total.
#
# llvm-cov: measured 31.09% with Apple clang 21 on macOS arm64 (TASK29).
# gcov: not yet measured (no gcc toolchain where TASK29 was written); set
# below the llvm-cov value as a start, to be raised to what the Linux CI
# job prints.
llvm-cov 31
gcov 25
